---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions - Flamingo"
  description="Flamingo Paper Products, Inc. Terms & Conditions for orders, site usage, wholesale transactions, and customer agreements."
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-separator">/</li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-current" aria-current="page">Terms &amp; Conditions</li>
    </nav>

    <article class="legal-article">
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <h2 class="sub-title">Flamingo Paper Products, Inc. &ndash; Standard Terms of Service &amp; Sale</h2>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
        <p>
          By accessing or using the FlamingoTissue.com website, purchasing products from Flamingo Paper Products, Inc. (&ldquo;Flamingo Tissue&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;), or issuing purchase orders for our goods, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions and our Legal Agreement. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>2. Product Specifications &amp; Availability</h3>
        <p>
          We take extraordinary care to describe and portray our paper products accurately, including roll sheet counts (750 sheets for Super Rolls, 550 sheets for Plus Rolls), ply specifications (Double-Ply), and case quantities (12, 24, and 48 roll packs). Product weights and dimensions are subject to standard manufacturing tolerances in the paper converting industry. All products are subject to inventory availability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>3. Quotations &amp; Wholesale Orders</h3>
        <p>
          All wholesale and distributor price quotes are valid for thirty (30) days from issuance unless otherwise specified in writing. Orders are accepted subject to credit verification and written confirmation by Flamingo Paper Products, Inc. We reserve the right to decline or cancel orders in cases of pricing typographical errors or carrier constraints.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>4. Freight, Delivery &amp; Risk of Loss</h3>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise negotiated in writing, commercial shipments are FOB shipping point from our City of Industry, California facility. Title to goods and risk of damage or loss pass to the buyer upon tender of goods to the commercial freight carrier.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>5. Payment Terms</h3>
        <p>
          Invoices are due upon the terms established in your commercial credit agreement (e.g. Net 30, Prepayment, or ACH Wire). Overdue balances are subject to a finance charge of 1.5% per month or the maximum permissible by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>6. Returns &amp; Claims</h3>
        <p>
          All claims for defective goods, concealed damage, or carton count discrepancies must be filed within ten (10) calendar days of delivery. Please review our <a href="/returns">Returns Policy</a> or contact <a href="mailto:support@flamingotissue.com">support@flamingotissue.com</a> for return authorization.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>7. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h3>
        <p>
          These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any dispute arising under these terms shall be resolved exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Los Angeles County, California.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h3>8. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-box">
          <p><strong>Flamingo Paper Products, Inc.</strong></p>
          <p>15117 Salt Lake Avenue</p>
          <p>City of Industry, CA 91746</p>
          <p>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@flamingotissue.com">support@flamingotissue.com</a></p>
          <p>Phone: <a href="tel:888-580-8091">888-580-8091</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .legal-article {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .sub-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--primary-dark-pink);
    margin-top: -0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section a {
    color: var(--primary-dark-pink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-box {
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-article {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
